  "priorExpiration": "2004-11-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 501.12 Beverages and Liquor Served. All beverages and liquor consumed on the club premises shall be those which are sold, or, in the case of tastings under RSA 179:44, served by the club except private groups may bring in and serve, or, if a one-day license holder, sell their own liquor and beverage in approved rental halls or rooms.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Liq 500) #5043, eff 1-11-91; ss and moved by #6391, eff 11-28-96 (from Liq 501.13), EXPIRED: 11-28-04\n\nNew. #8450, eff 10-21-05; ss by #10647, eff 7-24-14; ss by #13461, eff 10-13-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/liq100-1100.html"
